      <VERS vnumber="16">These <STYLE css="font-style:italic">are</STYLE> the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="3458">Ishmael</gr>, and these <STYLE css="font-style:italic">are</STYLE> their <gr str="8034">names</gr>, by their <gr str="2691">towns</gr>, and by their <gr str="2918">castles</gr>; <gr str="8147 6240">twelve </gr>
