      <VERS vnumber="17">And these <STYLE css="font-style:italic">are</STYLE> the <gr str="8141">years </gr>of the <gr str="2416">life </gr>of <gr str="3458">Ishmael</gr>, an <gr str="3967 8141">hundred </gr>and <gr str="7970 8141">thirty </gr>and <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
