        <gr str="2029">conceived</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="22">And the <gr str="1121">children </gr>struggled <gr str="7533">together </gr>within <gr str="7130">her</gr>; and she <gr str="559">said</gr>, If <STYLE css="font-style:italic">it is</STYLE> so, why <STYLE css="font-style:italic">am</STYLE> I <gr str="2088">thus</gr>? And she <gr str="3212">went </gr>to <gr str="1875">enquire </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>.</VERS>
