        <gr str="3816">people</gr>; and the <gr str="7227">elder </gr>shall <gr str="5647">serve </gr>the <gr str="6810">younger</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="24">And when her <gr str="3117">days </gr>to be <gr str="3205">delivered </gr>were <gr str="4390">fulfilled</gr>, behold, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">there were </STYLE>
        <gr str="8380">twins </gr>in her <gr str="990">womb</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="25">And the <gr str="7223">first </gr>was <gr str="3318">born </gr>
