        <gr str="6215">Esau</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="26">And <gr str="310">after </gr>that his <gr str="251">brother </gr>was <gr str="3318">born</gr>, and his <gr str="3027">hand </gr>took <gr str="270">hold </gr>on <gr str="6215">Esau’s </gr>
